<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>《九宮小六壬X奇門八神》 雙AI大模型超然速斷系統</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-primary: #0f172a;
            --bg-card: #1e293b;
            --border-color: #334155;
            --text-main: #f8fafc;
            --text-sub: #94a3b8;
            --accent-gold: #f59e0b;
            --accent-blue: #38bdf8;
            --accent-red: #f43f5e;
            --accent-green: #10b981;
            --accent-purple: #c084fc;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-primary);
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1280px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 15px;
        }

        h1 {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: var(--text-sub);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .control-panel {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .api-section {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
            border: 1px dashed var(--accent-gold);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .api-hint {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .form-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .form-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .form-group.full-width {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
        }

        label {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--accent-blue);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        input, select, textarea {
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.2s;
        }

        textarea {
            resize: vertical;
            min-height: 70px;
            font-family: inherit;
        }

        input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus {
            border-color: var(--accent-gold);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
        }

        .tab-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .tab-btn {
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: var(--text-sub);
            padding: 8px 18px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .tab-btn.active {
            background: var(--accent-blue);
            color: #0f172a;
            border-color: var(--accent-blue);
        }

        button.submit-btn {
            width: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d97706, #b45309);
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            padding: 14px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: opacity 0.2s;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        button.submit-btn:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .modal-overlay {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            z-index: 1000;
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
        }

        .modal-content {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 2px solid var(--accent-gold);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 30px;
            max-width: 550px;
            width: 90%;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        .modal-title {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .rules-list {
            padding-left: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .rules-list li {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        .rules-list li strong {
            color: var(--accent-red);
        }

        .modal-btn {
            width: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669);
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .modal-btn:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .results-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 25px;
        }

        @media (min-width: 960px) {
            .results-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 380px 1fr;
            }
        }

        .palace-board {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 8px;
            background: var(--bg-card);
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            height: fit-content;
        }

        .palace-cell {
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 10px 6px;
            text-align: center;
            min-height: 110px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .palace-cell.active-anchor {
            border: 2px solid var(--accent-gold);
            background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08);
        }

        .palace-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-sub);
        }

        .spirit-title {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            margin: 2px 0;
        }

        .relation-tag {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            padding: 1px 4px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .rel-bihe { background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2); color: var(--accent-blue); }
        .rel-sheng { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2); color: var(--accent-green); }
        .rel-ke { background: rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.2); color: var(--accent-red); }

        .sub-spirit {
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            color: var(--accent-red);
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .analysis-panel {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 25px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 6px;
            margin-top: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .section-title:first-child {
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        .card-box {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-blue);
            padding: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            font-size: 0.92rem;
        }

        .card-box.warning { border-left-color: var(--accent-red); }
        .card-box.summary { border-left-color: var(--accent-green); background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.05); }
        .card-box.purple { border-left-color: var(--accent-purple); background: rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.05); }
        .card-box.ai-analysis { border-left-color: var(--accent-gold); background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.05); }

        .weather-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .weather-card {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .weather-title {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--accent-blue);
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .weather-spirit {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .palace-detail-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 10px 0;
            font-size: 0.88rem;
        }

        .palace-detail-table th, .palace-detail-table td {
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 8px 10px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .palace-detail-table th {
            background: rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.5);
            color: var(--accent-blue);
        }

        ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; }
        li { margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 0.92rem; }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-right: 4px;
        }

        .badge-gold { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2); color: var(--accent-gold); }
        .badge-blue { background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2); color: var(--accent-blue); }
        .badge-purple { background: rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.2); color: var(--accent-purple); }

        .ai-loading {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        
        .spinner {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            border: 3px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
            border-radius: 50%;
            border-top-color: var(--accent-gold);
            animation: spin 1s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes spin {
            to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        .ai-response-block {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-gold);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin-top: 15px;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            font-family: inherit;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="rulesModal" class="modal-overlay">
    <div class="modal-content">
        <h2 class="modal-title">⚠️ 起卦核心原則聲明</h2>
        <ul class="rules-list">
            <li>1. <strong>無事不占</strong>：無實質困惑或重大戰略抉擇切勿無故起卦。</li>
            <li>2. <strong>一事不二占</strong>：同一事項在結果未明或未過驗證期前，嚴禁重複起卦。</li>
            <li>3. <strong>他人隱私不沾</strong>：未經授權或非自身相關之他人隱私私事，不得擅自起卦窺探。</li>
            <li>4. <strong>心不誠不占</strong>：心神散亂、抱持戲謔心態時，氣場雜亂，切勿起卦。</li>
            <li>5. <strong>身處不淨之地不占</strong>：嘈雜混亂或磁場不潔之場所不宜進行推演。</li>
            <li>6. <strong>子時不占</strong>：子時天地氣場交替混沌，易生判斷盲區，避開不占。</li>
        </ul>
        <button class="modal-btn" onclick="closeRulesModal()">我已明瞭，遵守規則並進入系統</button>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container">
    <header>
        <h1>《九宮小六壬X奇門八神》 雙AI大模型超然速斷系統</h1>
        <div class="subtitle">洛書對照 ➔ 中宮借位 ➔ 八神飛布 ➔ 自動同步 Gemini & OpenAI 嚴謹解卦</div>
    </header>

    <div class="control-panel">
        <div class="api-section">
            <div class="form-grid">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="geminiApiKey">Gemini API Key (可選填)</label>
                    <input type="password" id="geminiApiKey" placeholder="輸入 Gemini API Key">
                    <div class="api-hint">金鑰僅用於本頁面發送請求，系統不會儲存您的 API Key</div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="openaiApiKey">ChatGPT (OpenAI) API Key (可選填)</label>
                    <input type="password" id="openaiApiKey" placeholder="輸入 OpenAI API Key">
                    <div class="api-hint">金鑰僅用於本頁面發送請求，系統不會儲存您的 API Key</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group full-width">
            <label for="userQuestion">★ 提問內容／具體戰略決策問題</label>
            <textarea id="userQuestion" placeholder="請在此輸入您的具體問題...">請評估當前商業合作案之潛在風險與推進戰略</textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group full-width">
            <label>起卦方式</label>
            <div class="tab-buttons">
                <button type="button" class="tab-btn active" onclick="setMode('datetime')">時間起卦 (下拉選單)</button>
                <button type="button" class="tab-btn" onclick="setMode('numbers')">三個數字起卦 (1-99)</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="datetimeFields" class="form-grid">
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="calendarType">曆法選擇</label>
                <select id="calendarType">
                    <option value="lunar">農曆 (陰曆)</option>
                    <option value="solar">國曆 (陽曆)</option>
                </select>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="monthSelect">月數</label>
                <select id="monthSelect">
                    <script>
                        for(let i=1; i<=12; i++) {
                            document.write(`<option value="${i}" ${i===9?'selected':''}>${i}月</option>`);
                        }
                    </script>
                </select>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="daySelect">日數</label>
                <select id="daySelect">
                    <script>
                        for(let i=1; i<=31; i++) {
                            document.write(`<option value="${i}" ${i===1?'selected':''}>${i}日</option>`);
                        }
                    </script>
                </select>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="hourSelect">時辰數</label>
                <select id="hourSelect">
                    <option value="1">子時 (23:00 - 01:00)</option>
                    <option value="2">丑時 (01:00 - 03:00)</option>
                    <option value="3">寅時 (03:00 - 05:00)</option>
                    <option value="4" selected>卯時 (05:00 - 07:00)</option>
                    <option value="5">辰時 (07:00 - 09:00)</option>
                    <option value="6">巳時 (09:00 - 11:00)</option>
                    <option value="7">午時 (11:00 - 13:00)</option>
                    <option value="8">未時 (13:00 - 15:00)</option>
                    <option value="9">申時 (15:00 - 17:00)</option>
                    <option value="10">酉時 (17:00 - 19:00)</option>
                    <option value="11">戌時 (19:00 - 21:00)</option>
                    <option value="12">亥時 (21:00 - 23:00)</option>
                </select>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="numberFields" class="form-grid" style="display: none;">
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="num1">第一個數字 (1-99)</label>
                <input type="number" id="num1" value="15" min="1" max="99">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="num2">第二個數字 (1-99)</label>
                <input type="number" id="num2" value="28" min="1" max="99">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="num3">第三個數字 (1-99)</label>
                <input type="number" id="num3" value="37" min="1" max="99">
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="dunType">遁法 (氣場飛行模式)</label>
                <select id="dunType">
                    <option value="yang">陽遁 (冬至後到夏至前 / 順飛)</option>
                    <option value="yin">陰遁 (夏至後到冬至前 / 逆飛)</option>
                </select>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="domain">決策語境領域</label>
                <select id="domain">
                    <option value="business">商業投資與資本運作</option>
                    <option value="career">職涯攻防與組織權力</option>
                    <option value="relation">人際博弈與深層溝通</option>
                    <option value="dispute">法律訴訟與合約談判</option>
                </select>
            </div>
        </div>

        <button class="submit-btn" onclick="runAnalysis()">計算合盤數據並發送 API 超然解卦</button>
    </div>

    <div class="results-grid">
        <div class="palace-board" id="palaceBoard"></div>
        <div class="analysis-panel" id="analysisPanel">
            <div style="text-align: center; color: var(--text-sub); padding: 50px;">
                請確認起卦原則後，點擊上方按鈕生成合盤報告與 AI 診斷
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
let currentMode = 'datetime';

function closeRulesModal() {
    document.getElementById('rulesModal').style.display = 'none';
}

function setMode(mode) {
    currentMode = mode;
    const btns = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn');
    btns[0].classList.toggle('active', mode === 'datetime');
    btns[1].classList.toggle('active', mode === 'numbers');
    
    document.getElementById('datetimeFields').style.display = (mode === 'datetime') ? 'grid' : 'none';
    document.getElementById('numberFields').style.display = (mode === 'numbers') ? 'grid' : 'none';
}

